{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411030","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1141103001:1":{"text":"Who'd choose to be born in this barren desert if they had a choice?","source_cn":"如果可以选降生地的话，谁会选在这光秃秃的沙海呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8B54FE95C5D70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141103002:1":{"text":"The weather's brutal, food's scarce, and the predators are fierce... This is not an ideal place to settle.","source_cn":"恶劣的天气，匮乏的食物，强悍的猎物，这里并不是一个宜居之地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5323834879AD75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141103003:1":{"text":"Especially for the weak and sick. It's hard to survive here, but also extremely difficult to get out.","source_cn":"尤其是对于弱者来说，这里很难生存，但他们又都逃离不了这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0BBD68CF05192F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1141103003":{"text":"Especially for the weak and sick. It's hard to survive here, but also extremely difficult to get out.","source_cn":"尤其是对于弱者来说，这里很难生存，但他们又都逃离不了这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0BBD68CF05192F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141103004:1":{"text":"Yes. At the same time... It probably sounds weird, but this very sea of sand is also our sanctuary.","source_cn":"哈，说出来你们也许会觉得奇怪，但这里也是我们的庇护所。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B77361091842CB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141103005:1":{"text":"The Maulers have a saying that the kids that grow up in sandstorms are the blessed ones.","source_cn":"蛮血们有句流传很广的话，在沙暴中长大的孩子，也被沙暴钟爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8012862837E6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141103005":{"text":"The Maulers have a saying that the kids that grow up in sandstorms are the blessed ones.","source_cn":"蛮血们有句流传很广的话，在沙暴中长大的孩子，也被沙暴钟爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8012862837E6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141103006:1":{"text":"Danger can be a kind of protection.","source_cn":"危险，有的时候也能保护人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB34BB1FD0CE6CFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141103007:1":{"text":"We may not have had the happiest childhood in the Ashen Wastes, but the desert gives us perseverance and an unyielding fighting spirit.","source_cn":"在荒角沙漠长大的孩子也许并不幸福，但相对的，我们拥有坚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8ED4B38F6B6F5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141103008:1":{"text":"We've seen the world at its worst—or at least close to it...","source_cn":"我们见过这个世界最糟糕的样子，也许是最糟糕之一……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x810265E813590A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141103009:1":{"text":"For survivors of sandstorms, what's there to fear?","source_cn":"但我们经历过沙暴，连沙暴都能熬过去的我们，还有什么会害怕呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FEEC95EE6AFCE4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"(Look confused)","source_cn":"（表示疑惑）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11F446249F27A616","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Look confused)","female":"(Look confused)","variant_male_record_index":"64696","variant_female_record_index":"64697","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"What does that mean?","source_cn":"（表示认同）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA95866DA252A1B73","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What does that mean?","female":"What does that mean?","variant_male_record_index":"64698","variant_female_record_index":"64699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Because they're weak?","source_cn":"缺乏足够的力量吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh